=== ptargrep ===
DESCRIPTION ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#!/usr/bin/perl #!/usr/bin/perl
############################################################################
##
# Tool for using regular expressions against the contents of files in a tar
# archive. See 'ptargrep --help' for more documentation. #


FLAGS (7) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
-b, --basename     ignore directory paths from archive
-i, --ignore-case  do case-insensitive pattern matching
-l, --list-only    list matching filenames rather than extracting matches
-v, --verbose      write debugging message to STDERR
-?, --help         detailed help message

Pod2usage(-exitval => 1,  -verbose => 0, ───────────────────────────────────
    -message       "No pattern specified",
    -message       "No tar files specified",
